      "message": "test(motion): the slow adaptive trochoidal tests move to the heavy lane with light twins (slice A)\n\nThe six slow tests of adaptive_troch_tests.rs move, with their asserts\nand values unchanged, into the child module adaptive_troch_heavy_tests.rs\nwith a heavy-lane ignore. Each has a light twin in the same file that\nholds the same law on a reduced case. The parent file goes from 388 to\n219 lines. No library code changes.\n\nRefs #3514\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
